/* the rule is doing the separating, so the heading needs real air under it —
   at the old value the two read as one object */
/* The rule does the separating, so the heading needs air under it. The two
   link columns are short and the colophon is tall, which was leaving a large
   dead area on the right; the columns now sit closer together and the whole
   grid closes up under them instead of stretching to the page edge. */
