<section class="hero wrap">
  <p class="eyebrow">Sydney Density Deliberations · AMPLIFY × RadicalxChange</p>
  <h1><span class="fluid" id="fluid"><canvas class="fx" id="fx" aria-hidden="true"></canvas>Beyond</span>
    <span class="yimby">YIMBY</span><span class="vs">vs</span><span class="nimby">NIMBY</span></h1>
  <p class="lede">The fight looks bigger than it is. Beneath the headlines, the people who fight hardest over Sydney's density agree on a surprisingly long list of <em>specifics</em>—and so does everyone else.</p>
